hadiths[58]{hadithnumber,text}:
"520","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Jafar bin Muhammad se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko qamees mein ghusl diya gaya."
"521","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Sakhtiyani Ayyub bin Abi Tamima se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Sireen se, unhon ne Ansariya Umm Atiya se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamare paas tashreef laae jab Aap ki beti ki wafaat hui aur farmaya ke use teen ya paanch ya is se zyada martaba ghusl do agar tum ye dekho, pani aur beri se, aur aakhri mein kafoor ya kafoor mein se kuchh rakho, phir jab farigh ho jao to mujhe khabar do. Unhon ne kaha ke jab hum farigh hue to Aap ko khabar di to Aap ne humein apna tehband diya aur farmaya ke use is ka astra bana do. Yani apne tehband se Aap ka tehband muraad hai."
"522","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se, unhon ne Sanabihi Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke suraj taloo hota hai aur us ke sath shaitan ka seeng hota hai, phir jab buland hota hai to us se juda ho jata hai, phir jab seedha hota hai to us se milta hai, phir jab dhalta hai to us se juda ho jata hai, phir jab ghuroob ke qareeb hota hai to us se milta hai, phir jab ghuroob hota hai to us se juda ho jata hai. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne in ghadiyon mein Namaz se mana kya."
"523","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko teen safaid Sahuli kapdon mein kafan diya gaya jin mein qamees aur na amama tha."
"524","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko teen safaid Sahuli kapdon mein kafan diya gaya."
"525","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Abu Bakr Siddiq ne Aaisha se kaha jab ke wo beemar they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kitne kapdon mein kafan diya gaya tha, to Aaisha ne kaha ke teen safaid Sahuli kapdon mein. To Abu Bakr ne kaha ke ye kapda lo, Aap ke upar jo kapda tha jise mail ya zaafran lag gaya tha, to use dho lo phir mujhe is mein do aur kapdon ke sath kafan do. To Aaisha ne kaha ke ye kya hai, to Abu Bakr ne kaha ke zinda naya ka murda se zyada haqdar hai, aur ye sirf waqt ke liye hai."
"526","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf ke bete Humaid se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mayyat ko qamees pehnaya jata hai aur tehband bandhaya jata hai aur teesre kapde mein lapeta jata hai, phir agar aik kapde ke siwa kuchh na ho to usi mein kafan diya jata hai."
"527","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar janaze ke aage chalte they, aur khulafa isi tarah musalsal, aur Abdullah bin Umar."
"528","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Munkadir se, unhon ne Rabia bin Abdullah bin Hudair se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab ko dekha ke Zainab bint Jahsh ke janaze mein logon ko janaze ke aage karte they."
"529","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine apne walid ko kabhi janaze mein na dekha magar us ke aage. Unhon ne kaha ke phir Baqi mein aate aur baithte yahan tak ke wo un par guzarte."
"530","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke janaze ke peechhe chalna ghalat sunnat mein se hai."
"531","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ki beti Asma se riwayat kya ke unhon ne apne ghar walon se kaha ke jab main mar jaun to mere kapdon ko khushboo do phir mujhe khushboo lagao aur mere kafan par khushboo na chhidko aur mere peechhe aag na lao."
"532","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Saeed bin Abi Saeed Maqbari se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne mana kya ke un ki maut ke baad un ke peechhe aag lai jaye. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko suna ke wo is ko makrooh samajhte they."
"533","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Najashi ki khabar logon ko us din di jis din wo mare aur unhein lekar Eidgah ki taraf nikle aur unhein saf mein kya aur chaar takbeerein kahin."
"534","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Sahl bin Hunaif ke bete Abu Umama se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke aik miskeen aurat beemar hui aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us ki bimari ki khabar di gai, jab ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) miskeenon ki iyadat karte aur un ke bare mein sawal karte they, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab wo mar jaye to mujhe us ki khabar do. Phir us ka janaza raat mein nikla to unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jagana napasand kya, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne subah ki to Aap ko us ke muamle ki khabar di gai jo hua tha, to Aap ne farmaya ke kya maine tumhein hukm na diya tha ke mujhe us ki khabar do. To unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah hum ne napasand kya ke tumhein raat mein nikalein aur jagain. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikle yahan tak ke logon samet us ki qabr par saf mein khade hue aur chaar takbeerein kahin."
"535","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Ibn Shihab se us shakhs ke bare mein sawal kya jo janaze par baaz takbeer pae aur us se baaz foot jaye, to unhon ne kaha ke jo us se foot jaye use qaza kare."
"536","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Saeed bin Abi Saeed Maqbari se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abu Huraira se sawal kya ke tum janaze par kaisey Namaz padhte ho, to Abu Huraira ne kaha ke main Allah ki umr ki qasam tumhein batata hun, us ke ghar walon mein se us ke peechhe chalo, phir jab rakha jaye to takbeer kaho aur Allah ki hamd karo aur us ke Nabi par durood bhejo, phir kaho ke aey Allah ye tera banda aur tere bande ka beta aur teri bandi ka beta hai, wo gawahi deta tha ke tere siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad tere bande aur tere Rasul hain, aur tu use zyada janta hai, aey Allah agar wo neik tha to us ki neiki mein izafa kar, aur agar wo bura tha to us ki buraiyon se darguzar kar, aey Allah humein us ke ajr se mehroom na kar aur us ke baad humein aazmaish mein na daal."
"537","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke maine Abu Huraira ke peechhe aik bache par Namaz padhi jis ne kabhi koi khataya na ki thi aur maine unhein kehte suna ke aey Allah use qabr ke azaab se panah de."
"538","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar janaze ki Namaz mein qiraat na karte they."
"539","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdul Rahman bin Abi Sufyan bin Huw aitab ke ghulam Muhammad bin Abi Harmala se riwayat kya ke Abu Salma ki beti Zainab ki wafaat hui jab ke Tariq Madina ke ameer they, to un ka janaza Fajr ki Namaz ke baad laya gaya aur Baqi mein rakha gaya. Unhon ne kaha ke Tariq Fajr ko andhere mein padhte they. Ibn Abi Harmala ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Umar ko un ke ghar walon se kehte suna ke ya to apne janaze par abhi Namaz padho ya use chhor do yahan tak ke suraj buland ho jaye."
"540","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke janaze par Asr ke baad aur Fajr ke baad Namaz padhi jati hai jab dono apne waqt mein padhi jain."
"541","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke ghulam Abul Nazar se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne hukm diya ke Saad bin Abi Waqqas ke janaze ko jab wo mare masjid mein un par se guzara jaye taake un ke liye dua karein, to logon ne is par un ka inkar kya, to Aaisha ne kaha ke log kitne jaldi karte hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Suhail Ibn Baidha par masjid ke siwa Namaz na padhi thi."
"542","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Umar bin Khattab par masjid mein Namaz padhi gai."
"543","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Usman bin Affan aur Abdullah bin Umar aur Abu Huraira Madina mein janazon par Namaz padhte they, mardon aur aurton par, aur mardon ko Imam ke qareeb aur aurton ko qibla ke qareeb karte."
"544","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab janazon par Namaz padhte to salam kehte yahan tak ke jo un ke qareeb hota sun leta."
"545","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke shakhs janaze par Namaz na padhe magar jab ke wo paak ho. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke maine ahl-e-ilm mein se kisi ko na dekha jo zina ke bache aur us ki maan par Namaz padhne ko makrooh samajhta ho."
"546","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Peer ke din wafaat hui aur Mangal ke din dafan hue, aur logon ne Aap par akele akele Namaz padhi, un ki koi imamat na karta tha. To kuchh logon ne kaha ke mimbar ke paas dafan kiye jain. Aur dusron ne kaha ke Baqi mein dafan kiye jain. Phir Abu Bakr Siddiq aae aur kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmate suna ke koi nabi kabhi dafan na hua magar us jagah mein jahan wo faut hua. To un ke liye is mein khoda gaya, phir jab un ke ghusl ke paas hue to unhon ne un ki qamees utarna chaha to aik awaz suni jo kehti thi ke qamees na utaro, to qamees na utari aur Aap ko is mein ghusl diya gaya, Aap par durood ho."
"547","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Madina mein do shakhs they, un mein se aik lahd banata tha aur dusra lahd na banata tha, to unhon ne kaha ke in dono mein se jo pehle aae us ke amal par amal karo. Phir jo lahd banata tha aaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye lahd banai."
"548","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma kehti thin ke maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maut ki tasdeeq na ki yahan tak ke maine kudalon ki awaz suni."
"549","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ne kaha ke maine teen chand dekhe jo mere hujre mein gire, to maine apna khuwab Abu Bakr Siddiq ko bayan kya. Unhon ne kaha ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafaat hui aur un ke ghar mein dafan hue to Abu Bakr ne un se kaha ke ye tumhare chandon mein se aik hai jo un mein sab se behtar hai."
"550","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne siqa logon mein se aik se zyada se riwayat kya jin par wo bharosa karte they ke Saad bin Abi Waqqas aur Saeed bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail ki Aqiq mein wafaat hui aur Madina uthae gae aur wahan dafan hue."
"551","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main pasand nahi karta ke Baqi mein dafan hun, ke mere liye is ke siwa dafan hona is se zyada pasand hai ke main is mein dafan hun, ye sirf do shakhs mein se aik hai, ya zalim, to main pasand nahi karta ke us ke sath dafan hun, ya neik, to main pasand nahi karta ke mere liye us ki haddiyan nikali jain."
"552","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saad bin Muaz ke bete Amr bin Saad ke bete Waqid se, unhon ne Mutim ke bete Jubair ke bete Nafi se, unhon ne Hakam ke bete Masud se, unhon ne Ali bin Abi Talib se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) janazon mein khade hote they phir baad mein baith gae."
"553","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Ali bin Abi Talib qabron ko takiya banate aur un par lete they. Malik ne kaha ke qabron par baithne se sirf is liye mana kya gaya hai hamare khayal mein pakhane ke liye."
"554","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Usman bin Sahl bin Hunaif ke bete Abu Bakr se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Sahl bin Hunaif ke bete Abu Umama ko kehte suna ke hum janazon mein hazir hote they aur aakhri log na baithte they yahan tak ke unhein ijazat di jati."
"555","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abdullah bin Jabir bin Atik se, unhon ne Haris ke bete Atik se, jo Abdullah bin Abdullah bin Jabir ke naana un ki maan ke walid they, riwayat kya ke unhein Atik ke bete Jabir ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Sabit ke bete Abdullah ki iyadat ke liye aae aur unhein paya ke un par ghalba aa chuka tha, phir unhein pukara to unhon ne jawab na diya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Inna Lillahi padha aur farmaya ke aey Abur Rabi hum tum par ghalib aa gae. To aurtein cheekhin aur roin, phir Jabir unhein khamosh karne lage. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein chhor do, phir jab wajib ho jaye to koi rone wali na roe. Unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah wajoob kya hai, Aap ne farmaya ke jab mar jaye. To un ki beti ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam main umeed rakhti thi ke tum shaheed hoge kyunke tum ne apna saman taiyar kar liya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ne us ka ajr us ki niyat ke qadar waqe kar diya hai, aur tum shahadat kise samajhte ho. Unhon ne kaha ke Allah ki raah mein qatal hona. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shaheed Allah ki raah mein qatal ke siwa saat hain, taaun wala shaheed hai aur doobne wala shaheed hai aur pehlu ke dard wala shaheed hai aur pet wala shaheed hai aur jalne wala shaheed hai aur jo malbe ke neeche mar jaye shaheed hai aur jo aurat jam ke sath mare shaheed hai."
"556","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Ummul Momineen Aaisha ko kehte suna, jab ke unhein zikr hua ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte hain ke mayyat ko zinda ke rone se azaab diya jata hai. To Aaisha ne kaha ke Allah Abu Abdur Rahman ko bakhsh de, unhon ne jhoot nahi kaha lekin bhool gae ya ghalti ki, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik yahoodi aurat ke paas se guzre jis par us ke ghar wale ro rahe they to Aap ne farmaya ke tum us par rote ho jab ke use us ki qabr mein azaab diya ja raha hai."
"557","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke musalmanon mein se kisi ke teen bache na marte hain aur use aag chhuti hai magar qasam ko pura karne jaisa."
"558","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Amr bin Hazm ke bete Abu Bakr ke bete Muhammad se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Sulami Abul Nazar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke musalmanon mein se kisi ke teen bache na marte hain aur wo un par sawab ki umeed rakhe magar wo aag se bachao hote hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik aurat ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ya do, Aap ne farmaya ke ya do."
"559","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abu Hubab Saeed bin Yasar se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke momin musalsal apne bache aur apne ghar walon mein aazmaya jata hai yahan tak ke Allah se mile jab ke us ki koi khataya na ho."
"560","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Qasim ke bete Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke musalmanon ko un ki museebaton mein meri museebat tasalli de."
"561","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Rabia bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jise museebat pahunche aur wo kahe jaisa Allah ne hukm diya ke hum Allah ke hain aur hum usi ki taraf lautne wale hain, aey Allah mujhe meri museebat mein ajr de aur mujhe is se behtar de, magar Allah us ke sath aisa karta hai. Umm Salma ne kaha ke jab Abu Salma ki wafaat hui to maine ye kaha phir kaha ke Abu Salma se behtar kaun hai, to Allah ne un ke baad un ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) diye aur unhon ne un se nikah kya."
"562","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke meri aik biwi halaak hui aur Qurazi Muhammad bin Kaab mere paas aae aur mujhe us par tazeeyat di, phir kaha ke Bani Israeel mein aik faqeeh aalim aabid mujtahid shakhs tha aur us ki aik biwi thi, wo us se khush tha aur us se mohabbat karta tha, phir wo mar gai to us par sakht gham paya aur us par gham mila yahan tak ke ghar mein tanha hua aur apne upar band kar liya aur logon se parda kya, phir us ke paas koi dakhil na hota tha, aur aik aurat ne us ke bare mein suna to us ke paas aai aur kaha ke mujhe us se aik haajat hai jis mein us se fatwa mangti hun, is mein mere liye us se munh se kehne ke siwa koi chara nahi, phir log gae aur wo us ke darwaze par lagi rahi aur kaha ke mujh se us se baghair chara nahi. To aik kehne wale ne us se kaha ke yahan aik aurat hai jo tum se fatwa mangna chahti hai aur us ne kaha ke munh se kehne ke siwa nahi, jab ke log ja chuke hain aur wo darwaze se nahi hatti. To us ne kaha ke use ijazat do. Phir wo us ke paas dakhil hui aur kaha ke main tumhare paas aik muamle mein fatwa mangne aai hun. Us ne kaha ke wo kya hai, us ne kaha ke maine apni aik padosan se zewar udhaar liya aur main use pehenti aur aariyat leti rahi aik zamana, phir unhon ne is ke liye bheja to kya main ise unhein wapas karun, to us ne kaha ke haan Allah ki qasam. To us ne kaha ke ye mere paas aik zamana raha. To us ne kaha ke tumhara ise unhein wapas karna zyada haq hai jab unhon ne tumhein aik zamana udhaar diya. To us ne kaha ke Allah tum par rehem kare, kya tum us par gham karte ho jo Allah ne tumhein udhaar diya phir tum se le liya jab ke wo tum se is ka zyada haqdar hai, phir us ne dekha jis mein wo tha aur Allah ne use us ke qaul se faida diya."
"563","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abur Rijal Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne apni walida Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chhup kar nikalne wale mard aur chhup kar nikalne wali aurat par lanat ki, yani qabrein khodne wale."
"564","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha kehti thin ke musalman ki haddi ko marne ke baad todna us ke zinda hote hue todne jaisa hai. Gunah mein muraad hai."
"565","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Abbad se riwayat kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Aap ki wafaat se pehle suna jab ke Aap un ke seene se tek lagaye they aur unhon ne Aap ki taraf kaan lagaya, kehte ke aey Allah mujhe bakhsh de aur mujh par rehem kar aur mujhe buland sathiyon se mila."
"566","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Aaisha ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi nabi nahi marta yahan tak ke use ikhtiyar diya jaye. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Aap ko kehte suna ke aey Allah buland sathi. To maine pehchana ke Aap jane wale hain."
"567","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi mar jata hai to us par us ka thikana subah aur shaam pesh kya jata hai, agar Jannat walon mein se hai to Jannat walon mein se, aur agar aag walon mein se hai to aag walon mein se, use kaha jata hai ke ye tumhara thikana hai yahan tak ke Allah tumhein Qayamat ke din uthae."
"568","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Ibn Adam ke har hisse ko zameen khati hai siwa dumchi ki haddi ke, us se paida hua aur is mein joda jaye ga."
"569","Mujhe Malik se Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ansari Abdur Rahman bin Kaab bin Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke un ke walid Kaab bin Malik bayan karte they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke momin ki rooh parinda hai jo Jannat ke darakhton mein khati hai yahan tak ke Allah use us ke jism ki taraf lautae jis din use uthae."
"570","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya ke jab mera banda meri mulaqat ko pasand kare to main us ki mulaqat ko pasand karta hun, aur jab meri mulaqat ko napasand kare to main us ki mulaqat ko napasand karta hun."
"571","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik shakhs ne kabhi koi neki na ki, apne ghar walon se kaha ke jab mar jaye to use jala do phir us ka aadha khushki mein uda do aur aadha samandar mein, Allah ki qasam agar Allah us par qadir hua to use aisa azaab de ga jo jahano mein se kisi ko na de ga. Phir jab wo shakhs mara to unhon ne wo kya jo unhein hukm diya tha, phir Allah ne khushki ko hukm diya to us ne jo us mein tha jama kya aur samandar ko hukm diya to us ne jo us mein tha jama kya, phir farmaya ke tum ne ye kyun kya, us ne kaha ke tere khauf se aey Rab aur tu zyada janta hai. Unhon ne kaha ke use bakhsh diya gaya."
"572","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har bacha fitrat par paida hota hai, phir us ke maan baap use yahoodi ya nasrani banate hain, jaisa oont salim janwar se paida hote hain, kya tum is mein koi kati hui pati ho. Unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah jo chhota hote hue mar jaye use kya dekhte ho, Aap ne farmaya ke Allah zyada janta hai jo wo karne wale they."
"573","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Qayamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke shakhs shakhs ki qabr par guzre aur kahe ke kaash main us ki jagah hota."
"574","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Halhala ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad Daili se, unhon ne Kaab bin Malik ke bete Maabad se, unhon ne Ribi ke bete Abu Qatada se riwayat kya ke wo bayan karte they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas se aik janaza guzra to Aap ne farmaya ke aaram pane wala aur jis se aaram paya jaye. Unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah aaram pane wala aur jis se aaram paya jaye kya hai, Aap ne farmaya ke momin banda duniya ki mashaqqat aur us ki takleef se Allah ki rehmat ki taraf aaram pata hai, aur fajir banda us se bande aur shehar aur darakht aur janwar aaram pate hain."
"575","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke ghulam Abul Nazar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jab Usman bin Mazoon mare aur un ka janaza guzra ke tum gae aur is mein se kisi cheez se aaluda na hue."
"576","Mujhe Malik ne Alqama bin Abi Alqama se, unhon ne apni walida se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik raat khade hue aur apne kapde pehne phir nikle. Unhon ne kaha ke maine apni laundi Barira ko hukm diya ke un ke peechhe jaye, to wo un ke peechhe gai yahan tak ke Baqi mein aae, phir us ke kinare mein khade hue jitna Allah ne chaha ke khade hon, phir laute to Barira un se pehle aai aur mujhe khabar di, to maine subah tak unhein koi cheez zikr na ki phir Aap ko ye bataya to Aap ne farmaya ke main Baqi walon ki taraf bheja gaya hun taake un par Namaz padhun."
"577","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abu Huraira ne kaha ke apne janazon mein jaldi karo, kyunke ye sirf bhalai hai jise tum us ki taraf aage karte ho ya burai hai jise tum apni gardanon se utarte ho."
